s one reads as \"step 0\", !! which invites the question of what step zero is. character ( len = :), allocatable :: text if ( ctx_probing ) then text = \"The initial gradient check\" else text = \"Optimization step \" // to_char ( ctx_n_evaluations ) end if end function step_label","tags":"","url":"proc/step_label.html"},{"title":"run_geometry_optimization – metalquicha","text":"public  subroutine run_geometry_optimization(resources, config, sys_geom, bonds, error) Optimize sys_geom in place. Every rank calls this. On return rank 0 holds the optimized coordinates in sys_geom ; the\nother ranks hold the last geometry they were asked to compute, which\nis the same thing for every step but the bookkeeping of the last one.\nRank 0 is the only rank whose copy should be written out. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( resources_t ), intent(in) :: resources type( driver_config_t ), intent(in) :: config type( system_geometry_t ), intent(inout) :: sys_geom type( bond_t ), intent(in), optional :: bonds (:) type( error_t ), intent(inout) :: error Calls proc~~run_geometry_optimization~~CallsGraph proc~run_geometry_optimization run_geometry_optimization bcast bcast proc~run_geometry_optimization->bcast proc~begin_context begin_context proc~run_geometry_optimization->proc~begin_context proc~build_residues build_residues proc~run_geometry_optimization->proc~build_residues proc~dlfind_available dlfind_available proc~run_geometry_optimization->proc~dlfind_available proc~dlfind_optimize dlfind_optimize proc~run_geometry_optimization->proc~dlfind_optimize proc~end_context end_context proc~run_geometry_optimization->proc~end_context proc~error_has_error error_t%error_has_error proc~run_geometry_optimization->proc~error_has_error proc~error_set error_t%error_set proc~run_geometry_optimization->proc~error_set proc~freeze_term_list freeze_term_list proc~run_geometry_optimization->proc~freeze_term_list proc~probe_gradient probe_gradient proc~run_geometry_optimization->proc