ure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Source Code subroutine ecp_shell_allocate ( this , nprim ) !! Size one channel for `nprim` primitives class ( ecp_shell_type ), intent ( inout ) :: this integer , intent ( in ) :: nprim call this % destroy () this % nprim = nprim allocate ( this % radial_powers ( nprim )) allocate ( this % exponents ( nprim )) allocate ( this % coefficients ( nprim )) this % radial_powers = 0 this % exponents = 0.0_dp this % coefficients = 0.0_dp end subroutine ecp_shell_allocate","tags":"","url":"proc/ecp_shell_allocate.html"},{"title":"ecp_shell_destroy – metalquicha","text":"private  subroutine ecp_shell_destroy(this) Type Bound ecp_shell_type Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ecp_shell_type ), intent(inout) :: this Called by proc~~ecp_shell_destroy~~CalledByGraph proc~ecp_shell_destroy ecp_shell_type%ecp_shell_destroy proc~atomic_ecp_destroy atomic_ecp_type%atomic_ecp_destroy proc~atomic_ecp_destroy->proc~ecp_shell_destroy proc~ecp_shell_allocate ecp_shell_type%ecp_shell_allocate proc~ecp_shell_allocate->proc~ecp_shell_destroy proc~build_molecular_ecp_json build_molecular_ecp_json proc~build_molecular_ecp_json->proc~atomic_ecp_destroy proc~copy_atomic_ecp copy_atomic_ecp proc~build_molecular_ecp_json->proc~copy_atomic_ecp proc~molecular_ecp_allocate molecular_ecp_type%molecular_ecp_allocate proc~build_molecular_ecp_json->proc~molecular_ecp_allocate proc~read_json_ecp_element read_json_ecp_element proc~build_molecular_ecp_json->proc~read_json_ecp_element proc~copy_ecp_shell copy